SUMMARY:Lion\, Otter\, Beaver\, Golden Retriever\, Whats your learning sty
 le?
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:Identifying your personal learning style can help you understa
 nd and learn complex topics\, motivate you to stay focused\, and ultimatel
 y help you retain what youve learned. Are you a natural leader\, a playful
  spirit\, a loyal friend\, or a meticulous planner? Do you prefer written\
 , visual\, hands-on\, or auditory learning? Take this fun self-assessment 
 and find out! Register: Lion\, Otter\, Beaver\, Golden Retriever: Whats yo
